# Gitignore settings for ESPHome
**/.esphome/
/.vs/
**/.pioenvs/
**/.piolibdeps/
**/lib/
**/src/
/devices/build/
**/platformio.ini
/devices/secrets.yaml
# ESPHome rewrites this on every compile if it's missing; its rules are covered above
/devices/.gitignore
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
**/Thumbs.db
